sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Source
  participant E as ETL
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  participant A as Analyst
  S->>S: Append revision 2 with a new delivery sequence
  E->>S: Poll after last cursor
  E->>D: Append raw revision and project latest valid facts
  D-->>E: Commit projection and cursor
  A->>D: Request a new report via API
  D-->>A: New report alongside the original revision
